[temp.inst]/2, [basic.lookup.unqual]: a class template's (out-of-line) member is
instantiated in the context of the instantiated class, so a namespace-scope
typedef in the member's return type resolves correctly regardless of where the
instantiation is triggered.  Reduced from the interval_union.cpp dog-food
failure ("symbol '_StateIdT' is unknown").  Non-vacuous.
